"Medical Facials\",\n    \"description\": \"Cleansing, exfoliation and hydration chosen for your skin on the day.\",\n    \"url\": \"{{origin}}/treatments/facial\",\n    \"provider\": {\n      \"@type\": \"MedicalClinic\",\n      \"name\": \"Soie Clinic\",\n      \"url\": \"{{origin}}/\"\n    }\n  }\n  </script>\n  <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n  {\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"How is this different from a spa facial?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"At Soie, the session starts with an assessment of your skin and medical history. The products and steps are chosen around that assessment, with advice on aftercare and your home routine.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can I have a facial before a big event?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Tell us your event date and whether you have had the treatment before. We can suggest timing that allows for possible redness or sensitivity, especially if the session includes extraction or microneedling.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What is OxyGeneo?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"OxyGeneo is a facial treatment that combines exfoliation with the application of skincare ingredients. Ask our team which option is available and whether it suits your skin.\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }\n  </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"signature-site\">\n\n  <a href=\"#main\" class=\"skip-link\">Skip to content</a>\n\n  <header class=\"nav\" id=\"nav\">\n    <div class=\"nav__wrap\">\n      <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav__logo\" aria-label=\"Soie Clinic home\"><img src=\"/assets/images/logo.png\" alt=\"Soie Clinic\" width=\"68\" height=\"64\" /><span class=\"nav__logo-tag\">CLINIC</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"nav__links\" id=\"navLinks\" aria-label=\"Primary\">\n        <a href=\"/\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">Home</a>\n        <a href=\"/about\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">About</a>\n        <a href=\"/treatments\" class=\"nav__link is-active\">Services</a>\n        <a href=\"/devices\" class=\"nav__link\">Devices</a>\n        <a href=\"/results\" class=\"nav__link\">Before &amp; After</a>\n        <a href=\"/faq\" class=\"nav__link nav__link--secondary\">FAQ</a>\n        <a href=\"/contact\" class=\"nav__link\">Visit us</a>\n        <a href=\"/book\" class=\"btn btn--gold nav__menu-book\">Book appointment</a>\n      </nav>\n      <div class=\"language-switch\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Website language\" data-i18n-ignore>\n        <button type=\"button\" data-language=\"en\" lang=\"en\" aria-pressed=\"true\">English</button><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><button type=\"button\" data-language=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\" aria-pressed=\"false\">العربية</button>\n      </div>\n      <a href=\"/book\" class=\"nav__cta\" data-open-booking>Book appointment</a>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"nav__burger\" id=\"burger\" data-i18n-live aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"navLinks\"><span></span><span></span><span></span></button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main id=\"main\">\n    <section class=\"page-hero\">\n      <div class=\"page-hero__art\" data-bg=\"facial\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <picture>\n          <source type=\"image/avif\" srcset=\"assets/images/bg/facial-960.avif 960w, assets/images/bg/facial-1920.avif 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 90vw, 40vw\" />\n          <source type=\"image/webp\" srcset=\"assets/images/bg/facial-960.webp 960w, assets/images/bg/facial-1920.webp 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 90vw, 40vw\" />\n          <img class=\"hero-bg__media\" src=\"/assets/images/bg/facial-1920.jpg\" srcset=\"assets/images/bg/facial-960.jpg 960w, assets/images/bg/facial-1920.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 780px) 90vw, 40vw\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" />\n        </picture>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" data-reveal><a href=\"/\">Home</a> <span class=\"crumbs__sep\">·</span> <a href=\"/treatments\">Services</a> <span class=\"crumbs__sep\">·</span> <span>Medical Facials</span></nav>\n        <p class=\"eyebrow\" data-reveal style=\"margin-top:1.6rem\"><span class=\"eyebrow__dot\"></span> Treatment</p>\n        <h1 class=\"page-hero__title\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"1\">Medical Facials</h1>\n        <p class=\"page-hero__lede\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"2\">Cleansing, exfoliation and hydration chosen for your skin on the day.</p>\n        <svg class=\"page-hero__thread\" viewBox=\"0 0 420 20\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-reveal data-reveal-delay=\"3\">\n          <path d=\"M4 12 C 120 -4, 300 22, 416 8\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"url(#lgph)\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/>\n          <defs><linearGradient id=\"lgph\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0\">\n            <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8C8C8C\"/><stop offset=\"0.5\" stop-color=\"#545454\"/><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#333333\"/>\n          </linearGradient></defs>\n        </svg>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section\" style=\"padding-top:clamp(2.5rem,5vw,4rem)\">\n      <div class=\"container svc\">\n        <div class=\"svc__body\">\n          <h2>About the treatment</h2>\n          <p data-reveal>A medical facial starts with a skin assessment. Depending on your needs, it may include cleansing, exfoliation, extraction, massage and selected skincare products.</p>\n          <p data-reveal>Tell us about sensitivity, breakouts and the products you use at home. We can also discuss options such as Dermapen or OxyGeneo, including whether they suit you and how recovery differs.</p>\n\n          <h2>At a glance</h2>\n          <ul class=\"ticks\">\n            <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span>Help with surface buildup and dullness</span></li>\n            <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span>Cleansing and extraction where appropriate</span></li>\n            <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span>Products selected for your skin</span></li>\n            <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span>Separate assessment for Dermapen or OxyGeneo</span></li>\n            <li data-reveal><span class=\"tick\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> <span>Time to discuss your home routine</span></li>\n          </ul>\n\n          <h2>The treatment process</h2>\n          <ol class=\"mini-steps\" data-reveal>\n            <li><strong>Consultation and assessment.</strong> We check your skin's condition and sensitivity, and ask what you use at home.</li>\n            <li><strong>A personal plan.</strong> We explain the treatment options, likely results, possible side effects and cost before you decide.</li>\n            <li><strong>The treatment itself.</strong> We talk you through the session and check how you feel as we go.</li>\n            <li><strong>Aftercare and follow up.</strong> We explain how to care for the treated area and when to contact us or return for a review.</li>\n          </ol>\n\n          <h2>Expected results</h2>\n          <p data-reveal>Skin may feel cleaner, softer and more hydrated after a facial. The visible change and how long it lasts depend on your skin and the steps included.</p>\n\n          <h2>Recovery &amp; downtime</h2>\n          <p data-reveal>A simple facial may need little recovery time, though temporary redness can occur. Microneedling and other added procedures can need longer. We will explain aftercare for the session you choose.</p>\n\n          <h2>Who is it for?</h2>\n          <p data-reveal>A facial may help with dryness, congestion or dullness, but the steps need to suit your skin. Tell us about active irritation, allergies or recent treatments before booking.</p>\n\n          <h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>\n          <div class=\"acc\">\n            <details data-reveal>\n              <summary>How is this different from a spa facial?</summary>\n              <div class=\"acc__a\">At Soie, the session starts with an assessment of your skin and medical history. The products and steps are chosen around that assessment, with advice on aftercare and your home routine.</div>\n            </details>\n            <details data-reveal>\n              <summary>Can I have a facial before a big event?</summary>\n              <div class=\"acc__a\">Tell us your event date and whether you have had the treatment before. We can suggest timing that allows for possible redness or sensitivity, especially if the session includes extraction or microneedling.</div>\n            </details>\n            <details data-reveal>\n              <summary>What is OxyGeneo?</summary>\n              <div class=\"acc__a\">OxyGeneo is a facial treatment that combines exfoliation with the application of skincare ingredients. Ask our team which option is available and whether it suits your skin.</div>\n            </details>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <aside class=\"svc__aside\">\n          <div class=\"info-card\" data-reveal>\n            <span class=\"info-card__label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3.5 2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg> Session time</span>\n            <span class=\"info-card__value\">45 to 75 minutes</span>\n            <p class=\"info-card__text\">protocol dependent</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"info-card\" data-reveal>\n            <span class=\"info-card__label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3.5 2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg> Results</span>\n            <span class=\"info-card__value\">Immediate</span>\n            <p class=\"info-card__text\">may be noticed after one visit</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"info-card\" data-reveal>\n            <span class=\"info-card__label\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M12 7v5l3.5 2\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg> Frequency</span>\n            <span class=\"info-card__value\">Every 4 to 6 weeks</span>\n            <p class=\"info-card__text\">adjusted to your skin's needs</p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"info-card\" data-reveal style=\"text-align:center\">\n            <p class=\"info-card__text\" style=\"margin:0 0 1rem\">A consultation gives you time to ask questions before deciding on treatment.</p>\n            <a href=\"/book?service=facial\" class=\"btn btn--gold\" style=\"width:100%\">Book Medical Facials</a>\n          </div>\n        </aside>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <section class=\"section cta-band\">\n      <div class=\"container\">\n        <h2 class=\"cta-band__title\" data-reveal>Considering <em>Medical Facials</em>?</h2>\n        <p class=\"cta-band__sub\" data-reveal>Talk to our team about your concerns. We will assess the options and explain what treatment involves so you can decide.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta-band__actions\" data-reveal>\n          <a href=\"/book\" class=\"btn btn--gold btn--lg\">Book your appointment\n            <svg viewBox